BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F2 26 Tf 48 783.89 Td (The Inspection Playbook) Tj ET
BT 0.3 0.33 0.32 rg /F1 12 Tf 48 757.89 Td (The staff side of an Ofsted inspection, in plain English.) Tj ET
BT 0.05 0.36 0.27 rg /F2 11 Tf 496.56 791.89 Td (Staffbook) Tj ET
BT 0.42 0.45 0.44 rg /F1 8 Tf 443.22 775.89 Td (Free to keep, copy and share) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 11 Tf 48 677.89 Td (An inspection is not a mystery. On the staff side, inspectors ask for the same things almost every time,) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 11 Tf 48 661.89 Td (and every one of them can be ready before anyone knocks on the door.) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 11 Tf 48 640.89 Td (This playbook goes through the eleven things they open with. For each one: what they ask, what good) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 11 Tf 48 624.89 Td (looks like, what fails, and what to fix this week. Then the two scripts most homes never have, word for) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 11 Tf 48 608.89 Td (word. Then how to run your own mock inspection in an hour.) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 11 Tf 48 587.89 Td (It pairs with the free workbook, which does the tracking for you: the training matrix where every date) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 11 Tf 48 571.89 Td (you type gets its expiry computed and coloured beside it, the supervision tracker, the DBS re-check) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 11 Tf 48 555.89 Td (log, the diploma clocks and the governance clocks.) Tj ET
BT 0.42 0.45 0.44 rg /F1 9 Tf 48 534.89 Td (Nothing here is legal advice. It is the working knowledge of people who run homes, written down.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
