BT 0.42 0.45 0.44 rg /F1 7 Tf 48 30 Td (The Inspection Playbook · free from Staffbook · staffbook.co.uk) Tj ET
BT 0.42 0.45 0.44 rg /F1 7 Tf 525.1 30 Td (Page 2) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F2 15 Tf 48 763.89 Td (The eleven things, one by one) Tj ET
0.75 0.8 0.78 RG 0.6 w 48 757.89 m 547.28 757.89 l S
BT 0.05 0.36 0.27 rg /F2 11 Tf 48 729.89 Td (1. Statement of purpose) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 48 711.89 Td (The first document of every inspection. It describes what your home is for and how it is staffed.) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 58 693.89 Td (Good looks like: reviewed in the last year, matches how the home actually runs, staffing section is current.) Tj ET
BT 0.7 0.15 0.15 rg /F2 9.5 Tf 58 675.89 Td (What fails:) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 58 662.39 Td (written three managers ago. Says things the home no longer does.) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 58 644.39 Td (Fix this week: read it end to end. Mark every sentence that is no longer true. That is your revision list.) Tj ET
BT 0.05 0.36 0.27 rg /F2 11 Tf 48 616.39 Td (2. Staff list with qualifications) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 48 598.39 Td (Who works here, what they hold, and what they are working towards.) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 58 580.39 Td (Good looks like: one page, current, includes the Level 3 diploma clocks for anyone still inside their two years.) Tj ET
BT 0.7 0.15 0.15 rg /F2 9.5 Tf 58 562.39 Td (What fails:) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 58 548.89 Td (a payroll export with no qualifications on it.) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 58 530.89 Td (Fix this week: fill in the Diploma clocks tab in the workbook. Anyone red needs a plan today.) Tj ET
BT 0.05 0.36 0.27 rg /F2 11 Tf 48 502.89 Td (3. Recruitment and vetting records) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 48 484.89 Td (The full Schedule 2 file for every person: identity, DBS, references, history, qualifications.) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 58 466.89 Td (Good looks like: every file complete, and you know it is complete because someone checked against a list.) Tj ET
BT 0.7 0.15 0.15 rg /F2 9.5 Tf 58 448.89 Td (What fails:) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 58 435.39 Td (one unexplained gap in one work history. It is the fastest finding available to an inspector.) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 58 417.39 Td (Fix this week: run the Staff file checklist tab against your longest-serving person. Then the newest.) Tj ET
BT 0.05 0.36 0.27 rg /F2 11 Tf 48 389.39 Td (4. Training records) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 48 371.39 Td (Mandatory courses in date for everyone, with the expiry dates known, not guessed.) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 58 353.39 Td (Good looks like: a matrix where the expiry dates compute themselves and someone looks every Monday.) Tj ET
BT 0.7 0.15 0.15 rg /F2 9.5 Tf 58 335.39 Td (What fails:) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 58 321.89 Td (dates in someone's head. A first aid certificate that quietly ran out in March.) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 58 303.89 Td (Fix this week: move your dates into the Training matrix. Fix the first red Expires cell.) Tj ET
BT 0.05 0.36 0.27 rg /F2 11 Tf 48 275.89 Td (5. Supervision records) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 48 257.89 Td (Regular, effective, recorded. Including the manager's own supervision, which is the record most often missing.) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 58 239.89 Td (Good looks like: on the cycle your statement of purpose promises, showing real conversations with agreed actions.) Tj ET
BT 0.7 0.15 0.15 rg /F2 9.5 Tf 58 221.89 Td (What fails:) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 58 208.39 Td (gaps in the cycle. Records that are a date and two signatures. No record for the manager.) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 58 190.39 Td (Fix this week: fill the Supervision tracker tab. If the manager's row is red, fix that one first.) Tj ET
endstream
