BT 0.05 0.36 0.27 rg /F2 11 Tf 48 771.89 Td (11. Location assessment) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 48 753.89 Td (The annual review of whether the home's location keeps children safe.) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 58 735.89 Td (Good looks like: reviewed within the year, involving the local police and authority view, with the risks named and) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 58 722.89 Td (managed.) Tj ET
BT 0.7 0.15 0.15 rg /F2 9.5 Tf 58 704.89 Td (What fails:) Tj ET
