BT 0.42 0.45 0.44 rg /F1 7 Tf 48 30 Td (The Inspection Playbook · free from Staffbook · staffbook.co.uk) Tj ET
BT 0.42 0.45 0.44 rg /F1 7 Tf 525.1 30 Td (Page 6) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F2 15 Tf 48 763.89 Td (Run your own mock inspection in an hour) Tj ET
0.75 0.8 0.78 RG 0.6 w 48 757.89 m 547.28 757.89 l S
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 48 735.89 Td (Book one uninterrupted hour. Bring the self-audit sheet from the pack and pretend to be the inspector, which) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 48 721.39 Td (mostly means being politely relentless about evidence.) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 48 701.89 Td (First ten minutes: the eleven items. For each one, actually fetch the thing. Not "we have that" but the document,) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 48 687.39 Td (on the table. Grade it Ready, Question or Gap while it is in your hand.) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 48 667.89 Td (Next twenty minutes: two staff files, chosen the way inspectors choose. Your longest-serving person and your) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 48 653.39 Td (newest starter. Run the Schedule 2 checklist against both. The long-server tests your history; the starter tests) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 48 638.89 Td (your process.) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 48 619.39 Td (Next twenty minutes: follow one thread all the way down. Pick last month's regulation 44 report, take one action) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 48 604.89 Td (from it, and trace it: who owned it, when it closed, where the evidence lives. Inspectors pull threads; a thread that) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 48 590.39 Td (snaps in your hand snaps in theirs.) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 48 570.89 Td (Last ten minutes: write the list. Every Gap gets a name and a date. Every Question gets a sentence about what) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 48 556.39 Td (would make it Ready. Put the list where the team sees it.) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F2 10 Tf 48 536.89 Td (Do this once a quarter and a real inspection stops being an event. It becomes a Tuesday where you) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F2 10 Tf 48 522.39 Td (already know every answer.) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F2 15 Tf 48 488.89 Td (The new law, in plain English) Tj ET
0.75 0.8 0.78 RG 0.6 w 48 482.89 m 547.28 482.89 l S
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 48 460.89 Td (The Children's Wellbeing and Schools Act became law in April 2026. The headlines were about capping profits.) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 48 446.39 Td (The practical changes for a home's paperwork are quieter and worth knowing.) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 48 426.89 Td (There is more financial oversight, especially of larger providers. There is more attention on provider groups as a) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 48 412.39 Td (whole, not just single homes. And there is a clear direction of travel: be able to show where the money goes and) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 48 397.89 Td (how the home is run, because the asking is going to increase.) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 48 378.39 Td (For staff records this means three things. Workforce numbers, turnover and agency use, are becoming things) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 48 363.89 Td (people look at rather than vibes. Spending on quality and safety is the spending that always survives scrutiny.) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 48 349.39 Td (And records that can be produced quickly and completely are becoming the mark of a well-run home.) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F2 10 Tf 48 329.89 Td (None of this is frightening for a home whose files are straight. All of it is a reason to straighten them this) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F2 10 Tf 48 315.39 Td (quarter rather than next.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
