BT 0.42 0.45 0.44 rg /F1 7 Tf 525.1 30 Td (Page 7) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F2 15 Tf 48 763.89 Td (The pack, and one honest line) Tj ET
0.75 0.8 0.78 RG 0.6 w 48 757.89 m 547.28 757.89 l S
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 48 735.89 Td (The workbook next to this playbook holds nine working tools: the training matrix and its automatic expiries, the) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 48 721.39 Td (supervision tracker, the DBS re-check log, the diploma clocks, the governance clocks with the visit grid, the) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 48 706.89 Td (Schedule 2 file checklist, the employment gap worksheet, and the self-audit.) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 48 687.39 Td (Everything is free because every home needs this and most homes are too busy to build it. It was put together) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 48 672.89 Td (with a serving Responsible Individual with twenty years in children's homes. Use it, copy it, hand it to the home) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 48 658.39 Td (down the road.) Tj ET
BT 0.42 0.45 0.44 rg /F1 10 Tf 48 638.89 Td (That is the whole page. Good luck with the files, and better than luck: a quiet Monday habit.) Tj ET
